Hi,
I would like to simulate genotypes for a 4way cross using a linkage
map that I have generated from my mapping family.  The sim.map help
page states that the user can enter thier own marker locations with...

 'a list of vectors, each specifying the locations of the markers.
Each component of the list is given class A or X, according to whether
it is autosomal or the X chromosome'

I can easily create a list of vectors specifying the marker locations
for each linkage group, but I don't understand where to enter this
when running the sim.map( ) routine and none of the cases of example
code enter the marker positions manually. I'm sure this is an easy
fix, but I have not been able to get it to run.

Any suggestions?

Cheers,
Louis

